<view class="page {{theme === 'red' ? 'theme-red' : 'theme-blue'}}">
  <view class="disclaimer">数据来源：公开市场数据。收益为名义口径的历史演算，不构成投资建议。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="ar-loading"><text>正在聚合你这一年的持仓数据...</text></view>

  <view wx:elif="{{loadError}}" class="ar-loading">
    <text>暂无可统计的年度数据</text>
    <view class="ar-hint">添加持仓并积累交易日后可生成年度报告</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <canvas type="2d" id="annualCanvas" class="ar-canvas"></canvas>
    <view class="ar-actions">
      <button class="ar-save-btn" bind:tap="onSave">保存到相册</button>
      <button class="ar-share-btn" open-type="share">分享给好友</button>
    </view>
    <view class="ar-tip">保存后可分享到微信群/朋友圈；如需隐藏金额，先在首页开启「隐藏」再回到本页</view>
  </block>
</view>
